The method remove(int index) removes element at index, shifting subsequent elements left. The comment: "If the index is valid (greater than or equal to 0 and less than the initial size of the list), then for every element before the index, if the element was null before the operation, it remains null, or if it was not null, it remains equal to its previous value."

